Gen 34:1 , Dinah is ravished by Shechem;
Gen 34:4 , He sues to marry her;
Gen 34:13 , The sons of Jacob offer the condition of circumcision to the Shechemites;
Gen 34:20 , Hamor and Shechem persuade them to accept it;
Gen 34:25 , The sons of Jacob upon that advantage slay them, and spoil their city;
Gen 34:30 , Jacob reproves Simeon and Levi.
